From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernel32, kernelbase: volumes mounted on folders (6013)

SetVolumeMountPoint, Find{First,Next}VolumeMountPoint,
DeleteVolumeMountPoint, and GetVolumeNameForVolumeMountPoint of a mounted
folder (K-MOUNT). The mounted-folder part of the volume test runs now; what
our symlink-based junctions do not do yet is todo_wine.
